        "evidence": "PR #148 merged as 49a86522d6e6c69f4a552220b30fa510d3a5edd2 and consumed the sequence 5 authorization in run 31616764771 attempt 1. Validate succeeded, but publish failed closed before candidate download or registry authentication because GitHub's workflow-run pull_requests association was empty after merge. The temporary candidate artifact expired and no dependency artifact or final publication evidence exists. PR #149 repaired only the prospective pull-request association lookup, PR #152 fixed the candidate to React Router 7.18.2 and nanoid 3.3.18 without OpenVEX, and OWNER comment 5324238100 authorizes exactly one sequence 6 attempt after focused activation PR #153 merges from predecessor fdec9cdb170ed63d18735ef9f6d0abacc8e475ab."
