    "rationale": "ADR-0019 does not waive source identity, image signature, transparency-log, provenance, or evidence requirements. ADR-0023, ADR-0024, ADR-0026, ADR-0027, and ADR-0029 retain their exact bounded source remediations. Main run 31616764771 consumed sequence 5 and failed closed before candidate download or registry authentication because the workflow-run pull_requests association was empty after merge. PR #149 prospectively repaired that lookup without retroactively authorizing the failed run. PR #152 fixed the candidate to React Router 7.18.2 and nanoid 3.3.18 with raw High=0/Critical=0 and no OpenVEX. ADR-0030 and OWNER comment 5324238100 activate only PR #153 and exactly one sequence 6 push to reviewed main after exact final-head CI, review-thread, and OWNER attestation gates. Dependency admission, image, resident, Flux/runtime, credential, exposure, production, and Issue #63 closure authorities remain false."
